{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/7421","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"F128.67.B7 K3","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"7421","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Broadway  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Kerfoot, J. B.","id":"actor/kerfoot-j-b","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Houghton Mifflin Company","id":"actor/houghton-mifflin-co","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1911","begin_of_the_begin":"1911-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1911-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"grl copy : fair condition.|Inscription from J.B. Kerfoot to Alfred Stieglitz, undated : That celebrated / 'coon' of ours with  whose / face and with some of whose / bon mots you are familiar, said / the other day upon finding a copy / of Broadway on the library table, / 'Well, sah! Look at that! If Mr. / Kerfoot hasn't written a real book / with covers!' / If printed dedications were not / discountenanced in these shame-faced / times this modest secessionistic attempt / to catch the spirit of our beloved but / adolescent city would be inscribed to / Alfred Stieglitz / with the admiration, gratitude and / affectionate friendship / of J.B. Kerfoot.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From Georgia O'Keeffe's Ghost Ranch library.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}